!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/validate-type-valued-field.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/40/m/meta.tn"
@doc:"""
  A field typed `meta.type`: `shape` holds a type value as data, held to the kernel's types as any value is to its
  type, and declaring nothing ([TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2). A subject holding a value entry of `described` holds a value of
  that record.
  """
!schema {
  described => { name: text  shape: meta.type }
}
